  "name": "mem0",
  "description": "Mem0 Platform SDK for adding persistent memory to AI applications. TRIGGER when: user mentions \"mem0\", \"MemoryClient\", \"memory layer\", \"remember user preferences\", \"persistent context\", \"personalization\", or needs to add long-term memory to chatbots, agents, or AI apps. Covers Python SDK (mem0ai), TypeScript SDK (mem0ai), and framework integrations (LangChain, CrewAI, OpenAI Agents SDK, Pipecat, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, LangGraph). Also covers the open-source self-hosted Memory class. This is the DEFAULT mem0 skill for ambiguous queries. DO NOT TRIGGER when: user asks about CLI commands, terminal usage, or shell scripts (use mem0-cli), or Vercel AI SDK / @mem0/vercel-ai-provider / createMem0 (use mem0-vercel-ai-sdk).",
